<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Decapitate</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>decapitate corpse</a>
</pre>
<p>Use this command to cut the head off of your victims. A head is the proof of 
a kill: bring the head of a wanted criminal to the city guard Captain to 
collect the reward on it, or the head of a bounty target to the Bounty 
Hunters Guild. Some guild entry quests also ask for the head of a certain 
creature.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Decapitate</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Wanted</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Bounty</a>
</pre>




</div>